  "post_content": "<p>La Sala La Cassola de Onda acogi&oacute; la tarde-noche de ayer viernes la presentaci&oacute;n del corto dirigido por Salva Isert, con gui&oacute;n de Javier Aguilella, titulado Aloud: Libertad condicional, cuyo <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e894yjnFrno&amp;list=UU9kLQHFL9tRQkF_pLT0zWuQ&amp;index=3&amp;feature=plcp\" target=\"_blank\">tema central es la canci&oacute;n Cegar el mundo</a>. El dise&ntilde;o gr&aacute;fico es de Carolina Fern&aacute;ndez Scala.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7095.jpg\" alt=\"img_7095\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7096.jpg\" alt=\"img_7096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7097.jpg\" alt=\"img_7097\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7098.jpg\" alt=\"img_7098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7099.jpg\" alt=\"img_7099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7100.jpg\" alt=\"img_7100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7101.jpg\" alt=\"img_7101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7102.jpg\" alt=\"img_7102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curtaloudsalvaisert/img_7173.jpg\" alt=\"img_7173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
